00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:50.390
Okay, yes, it's dead center, 
but somehow, it's just not right!

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:53.320
But if that were all, it'd be all right.

00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:54.350
The real problem is...

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:59.480
When I was eight, my mother and grandfather 
were set upon by robbers and killed.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:01.860
And the mastermind behind it was...

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.140
My father.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:07.260
Of course, I didn't want 
to believe it, but...

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:12.560
You're in the way. Where are you looking?

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:16.540
The likes of you, the previous wife's daughter,
shouldn't be walking the halls!

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.550
This is...!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:23.280
People who care for you...

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:26.050
There isn't a single one left here.

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:31.780
The day after the funeral, my dad brought 
this stepmother and stepsister into our home.

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:36.060
He started treating me poorly,
 which probably meant just one thing.

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:37.800
Start cleaning!

00:12:38.760 --> 00:12:41.430
I'd wished for normal 
happiness in my next life.

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:43.080
Why did things turn out like this?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:47.740
<b>3 Months Later</b>

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.870
Instead of worrying about all that, 
I'll train in magic and swordplay!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.830
One of the true pleasures
of reincarnation in another world!

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:53.200
Yesterday, they went like this, right?

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:55.330
And the spell was...

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.630
Oh, right. That God-like person said

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:02.420
the magic of this world is 
created by nanomachines, right?

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:03.950
In that case.

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:07.230
Gather, water! Come to me!

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:09.050
<i>Nanomachines-san, looking 
forward to working with you!</i>

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:11.400
<i>Of course. It would be our pleasure!</i>

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.080
Huh? Who's there?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.400
Huh?

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:26.590
Don't surprise me like that, Nanomachines-san.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:30.440
Also, that looks like a 
swarm of bees. It's scary.

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:32.030
<i>My apologies.</i>

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.150
<i>What about this?</i>

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:39.130
You look like a scary thing I'd have to knock
 into a vat of molten steel. It's a bit...

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:40.850
Oh, I know!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.990
What about something like the yellow critter
 who travels with the "gotta catch 'em" guy!

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:47.130
Or the critter with the Kansai accent that's
 friends with the girl who captures cards...

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.720
<i>Forgive me.</i>

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:52.760
<i>I do not have any of the knowledge 
you carry from your previous life.</i>

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.390
Then anything's fine. Just be something cute.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.330
How many times does this make?

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:04.170
The one hundred and fifth time, I believe.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.490
Let's just go with this, then.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:10.680
Somehow, though I'm made 
of nanomachines, I also feel tired.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:13.200
At any rate, I'm looking forward 
to working with you, Nano-chan!

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.880
I've been through some horrible 
things since reincarnating,

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:20.140
but I was able to meet you, Nano-chan, 
so it isn't all bad. Right?

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:21.650
Though, after this,

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:26.750
she would learn that her abilities were 
6,800 times that of the average mage,

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:29.340
and grow even more bewildered.

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:35.100
As the daughter of the previous wife,
 I was driven from the house.

00:14:35.360 --> 00:14:37.010
So the scene changes to the royal capital,

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:39.980
and the Eckland Academy boarding school.

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:44.250
All right! I'm going to have my 
long-awaited normal school life!

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:48.890
There was a time I really thought that.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:50.740
Legendary Accident Number 1!

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.800
Accidentally firing off 
magic without using a spell.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:54.580
Number 2!

00:14:54.880 --> 00:14:57.840
Accidentally defeating a student 
who was proud of his abilities.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:58.710
Number 3...

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.540
Adele-chan!

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:04.140
Want to eat lunch together?

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:05.940
Want to go shopping with me?

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:09.340
Baby, your eyes shine like the very stars!

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:10.440
<i>Wha?</i>

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:15.110
<i>I've never really spoke to 
g-guys even in my last life!</i>

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:16.380
<i>At times like this...</i>

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.770
<i>All I can do is smile and try to play it off!</i>

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.500
Adele-chan!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.550
Huh?

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.270
Accidentally racking up smile points.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:31.530
I swore to myself that I wouldn't fulfill the 
"reincarnated with cheat-level powers" trope...

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:35.280
As you all know, these accidents 
continue to this day.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:40.520
<i>I just want to have fun at school 
with some friends. That's all...</i>

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:41.770
Adele-san...

00:15:41.770 --> 00:15:42.790
Yes?

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:45.920
I would like to speak 
with you about something.

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:46.920
Is now a good time?

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:50.380
<i>It's a well-bred girl with 
princess curls and her followers!</i>

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:54.050
<i>Th-This has gotta be that thing 
you always see in shojo manga!</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:58.560
Please don't make me go behind 
the school or to the bathrooms!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.640
Huh?

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:04.440
I-I'm sorry my room is so plain.

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:07.760
I can only work my part-time job 
on our one day off a week,

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:10.200
so I can't buy very many luxuries.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.250
What? Um, what about your allowance?

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:15.360
I don't get one.

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:18.660
Oh, then you must be a commoner like me.

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.730
Actually, I'm technically a noble, but...

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.120
Please pretend I never told you that.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:25.000
Why would you hide that?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:27.630
If you're from a noble family, 
you should take pride in your name!

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:31.000
My father has forbidden me from using our name.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:34.380
And if I make a wrong move, I might be 
murdered like my mother and grandfather were.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:35.260
<i>Murder?!</i>

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.990
Oh, it's nothing!

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:40.690
As long as I graduate, I'm pretty safe, but...

00:16:40.690 --> 00:16:45.270
If I go back, I'll be imprisoned, assassinated,
 or forced into a political marriage.

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:49.440
<i>I've never met these girls before!
 What am I saying?</i>

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.390
Sorry to keep you standing!

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:53.630
I'll go borrow some chairs!

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:57.330
The following memory is one 
even Mile-sama doesn't have.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.080
It is mine alone.

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:04.230
My lady, are you really going 
to give her a harsh scolding?

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:06.700
She really doesn't seem like 
a nasty, stuck-up honors student

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.950
who's making boys wait on her hand and foot.

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:11.590
You can't let her sob story sway you!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:14.850
I'll show you the monster under that mask!

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:17.580
Marcela-sama! You really shouldn't!

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:20.930
See? Look at all the luxurious dresses...

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:24.460
There's only tattered, plain clothes 
and poor-quality night clothes.

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.520
I-In that case!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:32.340
What is this?

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:34.790
Is this... her snack?

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.030
It's a snack for the neighborhood stray cat.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.420
I'm sorry! It took longer than I...

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:40.750
We'll take our leave.

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:45.710
E-Excuse me!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.300
Thank you for your kindness. But...

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:51.280
If we stay too long, we'd only be imposing.

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.210
We'll say farewell for today.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.470
I see. Then what about what 
you wanted to say to me?

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:59.880
We have all the time in the world to speak.

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:03.310
After all, we have three 
years before we graduate!

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:06.600
It was after that...

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:09.150
I don't know why,

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:12.720
but Marcela-san and the others 
started looking out for me.

00:18:13.560 --> 00:18:15.740
We were always together.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:19.820
It was the school life I'd always dreamed of.

00:18:20.100 --> 00:18:23.950
They were the first friends I'd ever had!

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.840
I see. So we're second, then.

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.960
Quite the player, I see.

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:29.810
Wha?

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:33.200
But if you found the 
friends you'd always wanted,

00:18:33.200 --> 00:18:35.380
why did you leave the school?

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.090
You didn't graduate, right?

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:38.640
That was...

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:42.850
It's because of what happened one year and 
two months after I started at the school.

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:46.680
The Third Princess of the Realm came into town,

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.180
and when I went to see...

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:54.800
Insolent peasant!

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:59.400
Do you cause this outrage knowing this 
is the carriage of Princess Morena?

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:02.700
<i>At this rate, that boy will die!</i>

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.200
<i>Am I going to die again?</i>

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.240
<i>I don't want to!</i>

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:10.870
<i>Lattice Energy Barrier!</i>

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.210
<b>Lattice Energy Barrier</b>

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.080
Wh-What is this?

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:17.050
Out of the way, you suspicious creature!

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:21.130
<i>I did it without thinking!</i>

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:22.880
<i>How am I getting out of this?</i>

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:26.640
You! Are you a demon—no, some kind of devil?

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.610
<i>Devil?</i>

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:29.770
<i>That's it!</i>

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:38.150
To cause harm to the vessel 
of a goddess! What disrespect.

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.360
It can't be... A goddess?

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:41.610
O Heavens...

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:45.160
Strike down the fools who dare defy the gods.

00:19:46.390 --> 00:19:48.450
Lightning... Break.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:53.770
If you find this divine 
punishment insufficient,

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:57.230
then shall I destroy the palace... 
No, the whole country.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:58.340
Please, wait!

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:01.750
Goddess, please have mercy.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:05.260
As princess, the fault lies entirely with me.

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:07.390
It's a super-cute princess!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.160
No, princess!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:11.550
Goddess, pass your divine judgment on me!

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:12.810
No, on me!

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:17.400
Wow! They're amazing! Should I step up, too?

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.140
<i>Oh no!</i>

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:19.690
<i>I went too far!</i>

00:20:19.690 --> 00:20:21.780
Th-There will be no second chances.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.220
Yes, O Divine One.

00:20:24.020 --> 00:20:28.080
You must never tell anyone 
of my descent to this place.

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:30.950
If this covenant is broken,

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.780
great catastrophe shall befall you!

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:35.020
Slump...

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:40.980
Huh? How strange? I can't 
remember what happened just now!

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:44.470
I thought I'd smoothed things 
over pretty well, but...

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:48.720
Word that the vessel of a goddess 
was a student at Eckland Academy

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:51.810
ended up reaching all the way up to the king.

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:57.520
I wanted a normal life, so I had 
no choice but to leave the school.

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:59.980
I set out for the Kingdom of Tils.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:03.070
<i>Farewell, my friends. Until we meet again!</i>

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.280
<i>I will become a Hunter!</i>

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:09.830
That's how I went from 
being Adele to being Mile.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:14.750
I get it. I'm not the only one carrying 
the weight of the past with me. Right?

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:16.130
Pauline is, too.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.540
And M-Mavis, too...

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:21.420
Honestly! You don't have to try 
to spare my feelings like that!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:26.380
Reina-san, you're afraid of losing 
your friends... your family, right?

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:28.190
Yes! Is that so wrong?

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.900
I lost my family twice.

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:34.260
I couldn't stand losing everything again.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.690
We'll be okay.

00:21:36.920 --> 00:21:37.770
Huh?

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:40.580
There's no telling how our lives will go,

00:21:40.580 --> 00:21:42.660
but we did swear, didn't we?

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:44.520
Our bonds are unbreakable.

00:21:44.520 --> 00:21:46.650
We are the Crimson Vow...

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:49.280
And we're not going to die easily.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:51.060
Not with Mile leading the way.

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:52.310
Of course not!

00:21:52.310 --> 00:21:55.180
Could you please stop 
talking about me like that?

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:57.970
I don't want to stand out!

00:22:01.360 --> 00:22:05.010
<i>This time, I won't lose my family!</i>

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:12.970
Didn't I Say to Make My Abilities 
Average in the Next Life?!
